    notes: "FL: Primary text read section-open 2026-09-26 from the official 2026 Florida Statutes (flsenate.gov / leg.state.fl.us), with per-section history lines. Controlling text: Fla. Stat. §83.63 (s. 1, ch. 2025-190, effective on becoming law per Laws of Fla. ch. 2025-190 s. 30). The belongings-collection duty in §83.63(2) is new in 2025. If terminated, the landlord must comply with §83.49(3) (§83.63(1)). No landlord termination right for casualty in Part II; none is claimed. topic_key shared with casualty-loss-tx and casualty-termination-nv.",
